title: Straight quotation marks, thus saving one key
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki
year: 1893

<<<
For some time past the manufacturers of typewriters have adopted straight quotation marks, for the reason that the same character can be used at the beginning and end of the sentence, thus saving one key.
<<< //The Stenographer//, 1893